,autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={}},rwwp09={id="rwwp09",name="地洞",dsc="一个有些粗糙的地洞，出口在柳树下。",canSee=1,caozuoName1="进入",buttonShow1=1,condition1={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result1={{type="doc",args={"CYN你顺着地洞走到了柳树边。NOR"}},{type="transfer",args={"hdroom0925"}}},buttonShow2=1,condition2={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result2={},buttonShow3=1,condition3={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result3={},buttonShow4=1,condition4={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result4={},buttonShow5=1,condition5={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result5={},buttonShow6=1,condition6={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result6={},autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={}},rwwp10={id="rwwp10",name="灵蛇轿",dsc="两个并排放着的木制轿子，轿子上便是村民口中的灵蛇，也是灵蛇丹的药材。轿子蒙着红布，你看不清那灵蛇的模样，但你觉得那并不像蛇。",canSee=1,caozuoName1="查看",buttonShow1=1,condition1={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result1={{type="doc",args={"CYN红布之下的活物在轻微的挣扎，扭动的身躯有些像蛇，又有些怪异。NOR"}}},buttonShow2=1,condition2={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result2={},buttonShow3=1,condition3={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result3={},buttonShow4=1,condition4={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result4={},buttonShow5=1,condition5={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result5={},buttonShow6=1,condition6={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result6={},autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={}},rwwp11={id="rwwp11",name="祭坛",dsc="三河村举行灵蛇祭的祭坛，祭坛是个坑洞，上方悬着巨大的石块，石块下架着机关可以控制石块，与其说是祭坛，实际更像个巨大的磨盘。每每灵蛇祭都会将灵蛇置于坛上，随后落下石块，将灵蛇磨成血水，最后药材一起制成灵蛇丹。因常被血水浸染，祭坛呈黑色，散发出浓重的腥臭味。",canSee=1,caozuoName1="查看",buttonShow1=1,condition1={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result1={{type="doc",args={"CYN洞中的众人念完祷词后，乔宁秋和祁康安等人上前架起灵蛇往祭坛走去。忽然一个十五六岁着青衫的女子冲上前去，扯掉了盖着灵蛇的红布，这时你才看清那所谓的灵蛇是不过十岁的男孩和女孩。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={1,"少侠，稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"CYN男孩和女孩全身长着像蛇一般的鳞片，他们的嘴巴被缝起，手被缝在身体上，双脚也被缝起，就像一条蛇。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={1,"少侠，稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"CYN青衫女子在那里大骂，声音像是从远古传来，朦胧不清，但跪伏着的村民所说，却字字清晰。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={1,"少侠，稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"YEL苏长荣：哪有什么人……明明是至纯的灵蛇。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={1,"少侠，稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"YEL孙大娘：真是罪孽，不要惊吓到灵蛇……NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={1,"少侠，稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"CYN青衫女子被拖走了，灵蛇被投进祭坛，巨大的石块压下，欢呼声和血腥气一样浓重，扑面而来。NOR"}},{type="showbutton",args={1,0}},{type="showbutton",args={2,1}}},caozuoName2="查看",buttonShow2=0,condition2={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result2={{type="doc",args={"CYN又是几场祭祀过去，每次都有新的人上前反抗，有的被当场挖眼拔舌，有的被悬梁而尽……最后再没有人起来，只剩下一群伥鬼。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={1,"少侠，稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"CYN眼前的场景愈发虚幻，你只觉得头重脚轻栽倒在地，苏醒时却发现自己不在阴暗的山洞里，而是躺在一个密室中。乔宁心正往你嘴中送水。NOR"}},{type="gaintab",args={"39005",5}},{type="transfer",args={"hdroom0947"}}},buttonShow3=1,condition3={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result3={},buttonShow4=1,condition4={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result4={},buttonShow5=1,condition5={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result5={},buttonShow6=1,condition6={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result6={},autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoR